<title>FRANCE: France's Juppe to give TV interview on Thursday.</title>
<headline>France's Juppe to give TV interview on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Alain Juppe will give an interview on France 2 television on Thursday at 8 p.m. (1900 GMT), the network said.</p>
<p>It gave no indication of what he would talk about.</p>
</text>
